/*
================================================================================
CREDIT BUREAU DATAMART - FEATURE ENGINEERING FOR SCORING MODEL
================================================================================
Purpose: Transform raw credit bureau (MKR) data into scoring model features
Source:  MKR_DATA (imported from Excel/credit bureau)
Output:  All features aggregated at customer (ID) level via CTEs

Note:    This script uses Common Table Expressions (CTEs) instead of CREATE TABLE
         statements, allowing execution without table creation permissions.

================================================================================
CTE CHAIN FLOW
================================================================================

Stage 1: Data Preparation
  - MKR_DATA_1:  Customer demographic data (deduplicated)
  - MKR_DATA_2:  Loan/liability details (credit type, amounts, status)
  - MKR_DATA_3:  Payment history (overdue periods and days)

Stage 2: Product Derivation
  - MKR_PRODUCT: Derived fields including:
    * CREDIT_TYPE_DRV: Mapped credit types (001=Consumer, 002=Auto, 003=Credit Card, 300=Mortgage)
    * Currency conversion to AZN (USD=1.7, EUR=1.9, RUB=0.025)
    * CREDIT_STATUS_DRV: Simplified status (001=Closed Good, 007=Open, 008=Closed Bad)
    * ACCOUNT_PAYMENT_STATUS: Payment history string for WPS calculation
    * INSTALLMENT_AMOUNT: Calculated monthly payment

Stage 3: Feature Aggregation (MKR_LONGLIST_TMP1-16)
  Temporary tables calculating features by product type:
  - TMP1:  Consumer Loans (CL_) count features
  - TMP2:  Home Loans/Mortgage (HL_) count features
  - TMP3:  Credit Cards (CC_) count features
  - TMP4:  Overdraft Lines (OL_) count features
  - TMP5:  Credit Cards + Overdrafts combined (CCOL_)
  - TMP6:  All Consumer + Home Loans (CHL_) count features
  - TMP7:  All Products (ALL_) count features
  - TMP8:  Bank count features
  - TMP9:  Consumer Loans (CL_) amount features
  - TMP10: Home Loans (HL_) amount features
  - TMP11-16: Additional amount aggregations

Stage 4: Final Feature Tables
  - MKR_LONGLIST_OPNCNT:  Open loan count features (all product types)
  - MKR_LONGLIST_OTHRCNT: Other count features (closed, bad, etc.)
  - MKR_LONGLIST_OPNAMT:  Open loan amount features
  - MKR_LONGLIST_OTHRAMT: Other amount features
  - MKR_LONGLIST_PERF:    Credit limit utilization ratios
  - MKR_LONGLIST_SCR_CODES: Score adjustment codes

================================================================================
FEATURE NAMING CONVENTIONS
================================================================================

Product Type Prefixes:
  CL_    = Consumer Loans (CREDIT_TYPE_DRV = '001')
  HL_    = Home Loans / Mortgage (CREDIT_TYPE_DRV = '300')
  CC_    = Credit Cards (CREDIT_TYPE_DRV = '003')
  OL_    = Overdraft Lines (CREDIT_TYPE_DRV = '002')
  CCOL_  = Credit Cards + Overdrafts combined
  CHL_   = Consumer + Home Loans combined
  ALL_   = All product types

Feature Type Suffixes:
  CNT_   = Count of loans
  OCNT_  = Open loan count (CREDIT_STATUS_DRV = '007')
  GDCLSCNT_ = Good closed count (CREDIT_STATUS_DRV = '001')
  BDCLSCNT_ = Bad closed count (CREDIT_STATUS_DRV = '008')

  OSMAMT_   = Open sum of initial amounts
  OSMTOB_   = Open sum of total outstanding balance
  OSMLMT_   = Open sum of credit limits
  OSMINS_   = Open sum of installment amounts
  OAVGINS_  = Open average installment
  OLMTUTL_  = Open limit utilization ratio

Time Window Suffixes:
  _EVER       = All time / lifetime
  _30D        = Last 30 days
  _90D        = Last 90 days
  _182D       = Last 6 months (182 days)
  _183D365D   = 6-12 months ago
  _365D       = Last 12 months
  _730D       = Last 24 months
  _1095D      = Last 36 months

Payment Status Suffixes (WPS = Worst Payment Status):
  _CWPS0_     = Current WPS = 0 (current/on-time)
  _CWPS1_6_   = Current WPS between 1-6 (30-180 DPD)
  _CWPS6P_    = Current WPS > 6 (180+ DPD)
  _CWPSUD_    = Current WPS undefined
  _6MWPS_X_   = Worst status in last 6 months = X
  _12MWPS_X_  = Worst status in last 12 months = X
  _24MWPS_X_  = Worst status in last 24 months = X
  _36MWPS_X_  = Worst status in last 36 months = X

Other Suffixes:
  _O          = Excluding own bank (Bank of Baku)
  _MXDLQ0_    = Max delinquency = 0 in last 12 months
  _MXDLQ1_    = Max delinquency <= 1 in last 12 months
  _DLQ2_      = Contains delinquency status 2 in last 12 months
  _DLQ3_      = Contains delinquency status 3 in last 12 months

================================================================================
CREDIT STATUS CODES
================================================================================
  001 = Closed (Good) - includes 010, 012
  007 = Open/Active - includes 002, 004, 006, 009
  008 = Closed (Bad/Default) - includes 003, 011, or 180+ DPD

================================================================================
DEPENDENCIES
================================================================================
  - Source: scoring.qnb_mkr_data_mba_backup (credit bureau data)
  - Lookups: dwmain.dg_credit_type, dwmain.dg_loan_purpose, dwmain.dg_colleteral_types
  - FIN mapping: iibahramova.tmp_mkr_fin_random

  Note: WPS() and ACCPYMTSTDRV() functions have been inlined - no function creation needed

================================================================================
INLINE FUNCTION REPLACEMENTS (for read-only database access)
================================================================================
The following PL/SQL functions have been inlined as SQL expressions:

1. WPS(string) - Worst Payment Status
   Returns the maximum (worst) payment status code from a payment history string.
   Character mapping: 0-9=numeric, T=8, L/K=9, D/U/X/N=-1, NULL=-3, other=-2

   Inline pattern (for single character):
   CASE UPPER(SUBSTR(str,pos,1))
     WHEN 'T' THEN 8 WHEN 'L' THEN 9 WHEN 'K' THEN 9
     WHEN 'D' THEN -1 WHEN 'U' THEN -1 WHEN 'X' THEN -1 WHEN 'N' THEN -1
     WHEN '0' THEN 0 ... WHEN '9' THEN 9
     ELSE -2
   END

   For multi-character strings: GREATEST() over all positions

2. ACCPYMTSTDRV(string, mkr_date_yyyymm, overdue_date_yyyymm)
   Aligns payment history string to MKR report date.
   Inlined as CASE expression with LPAD/SUBSTR based on month difference

================================================================================
PARAMETERS (substitute before running)
================================================================================
  - &start_date: Start date filter (DD.MM.YYYY format)
  - &end_date:   End date filter (DD.MM.YYYY format)

================================================================================
LAST UPDATED: 04.03.2025
================================================================================
*/


-- =============================================================================
-- STAGE 0: SOURCE DATA EXTRACTION (from scoring.qnb_mkr_data_mba_backup)
-- =============================================================================

WITH MKR_DATA AS (
    SELECT
        qnb.mkr_id                                          AS id,
        fin_map.finreal                                     AS fin,
        qnb.p_id                                            AS id_2,
        qnb.mkr_id,
        qnb.bank_id,
        qnb.bank_name,
        qnb.credit_type,
        credit_type_lookup.name_az                          AS credittype_name,
        credit_type_lookup.name_az                          AS cr_type_look,
        qnb.credit_purpose,
        purpose_lookup.name_az                              AS creditpurpose_name,
        qnb.org_type,
        CASE
            WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(qnb.date_of_birth, '^\d{2}/\d{2}/\d{4}$')
                THEN TO_DATE(qnb.date_of_birth, 'DD/MM/YYYY')
            WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(qnb.date_of_birth, '^\d{2}-[A-Z]{3}-\d{2}$')
                THEN TO_DATE(qnb.date_of_birth, 'DD-MON-RR')
            ELSE NULL
        END                                                 AS date_of_birth,
        TO_DATE(qnb.mkr_date, 'DD.MM.YYYY')                AS mkr_date,
        TO_DATE(qnb.mkr_date, 'DD.MM.YYYY')                AS req_date,
        TO_DATE(SUBSTR(qnb.granted_on, 1, 10), 'YYYY-MM-DD') AS granted_on,
        TO_DATE(SUBSTR(qnb.contract_due_on, 1, 10), 'YYYY-MM-DD') AS contract_due_on,
        TO_DATE(SUBSTR(qnb.last_update_date, 1, 10), 'YYYY-MM-DD') AS last_update_date,
        TO_DATE(SUBSTR(qnb.last_payment_date, 1, 10), 'YYYY-MM-DD') AS last_payment_date,
        TO_DATE(SUBSTR(qnb.credit_status_close_date, 1, 10), 'YYYY-MM-DD') AS credit_status_close_date,
        TO_DATE(qnb.overdue_period, 'YYYY-MM-DD')          AS overdue_period,
        TO_DATE(SUBSTR(qnb.file_date, 1, 10), 'YYYY-MM-DD') AS file_date,
        qnb.initial_amount,
        qnb.line_ammount,
        qnb.outstanding_debt_main,
        qnb.outstanding_debt_interest,
        qnb.monthly_payment_amount,
        qnb.interest_rate,
        qnb.days_interest_overdue,
        qnb.days_main_sum_overdue,
        qnb.overdue_days,
        qnb.prolongations,
        qnb.l_credit_status,
        qnb.lh_credit_status                               AS credit_status,
        qnb.collateral_code,
        collateral_lookup.name                             AS collateralt_type_name,
        collateral_lookup.name                             AS colletaral,
        qnb.collateral_market_value,
        qnb.collateral_registry_agency,
        TO_DATE(SUBSTR(qnb.collateral_registry_date, 1, 10), 'YYYY-MM-DD') AS collateral_registry_date,
        qnb.collateral_registry_no,
        qnb.collateral_any_info,
        qnb.currency,
        qnb.fk_person_liability                            AS liabilityid
    FROM scoring.qnb_mkr_data_mba_backup qnb
    LEFT JOIN iibahramova.tmp_mkr_fin_random fin_map
        ON qnb.fin = fin_map.finrandom
    LEFT JOIN dwmain.dg_credit_type credit_type_lookup
        ON qnb.credit_type = credit_type_lookup.code
    LEFT JOIN dwmain.dg_loan_purpose purpose_lookup
        ON qnb.credit_purpose = purpose_lookup.code
    LEFT JOIN dwmain.dg_colleteral_types collateral_lookup
        ON qnb.collateral_code = collateral_lookup.code
    WHERE TRUNC(TO_DATE(qnb.mkr_date, 'DD.MM.YYYY'))
        BETWEEN TO_DATE('01.01.2018', 'DD.MM.YYYY')
            AND TO_DATE('01.01.2019', 'DD.MM.YYYY')
),

-- =============================================================================
-- STAGE 1: DATA PREPARATION
-- =============================================================================

----------------------------------------
-- MKR_DATA_1: Customer Demographics (Deduplicated)
----------------------------------------

MKR_DATA_1 AS (

SELECT  DISTINCT
        MKR_DATE,
        ID,
        DATE_OF_BIRTH,
        FILE_DATE
FROM MKR_DATA  -- From CTE above

),


----------------------------------------
-- MKR_DATA_2: Loan/Liability Details
----------------------------------------

MKR_DATA_2 AS (

SELECT  DISTINCT
    MKR_DATE,
        FIN,
        ID,
        ID_2,
        --RECORD_DATE_2,
        --MODIFICATION_DATE_2,
        --STATUS_2,
        CREDIT_TYPE,
        ORG_TYPE,
        BANK_ID,
        BANK_NAME,
        INITIAL_AMOUNT,
        LINE_AMMOUNT,
        OUTSTANDING_DEBT_MAIN,
        OUTSTANDING_DEBT_INTEREST,
        CURRENCY,
        MKR_ID,
        MONTHLY_PAYMENT_AMOUNT,
        LAST_UPDATE_DATE,
        LAST_PAYMENT_DATE,
        CREDIT_PURPOSE,
        GRANTED_ON,
        CONTRACT_DUE_ON,
        DAYS_MAIN_SUM_OVERDUE,
        DAYS_INTEREST_OVERDUE,
        PROLONGATIONS,
        COLLATERAL_CODE,
        COLLATERAL_MARKET_VALUE,
        COLLATERAL_REGISTRY_AGENCY,
        COLLATERAL_REGISTRY_DATE,
        COLLATERAL_REGISTRY_NO,
        COLLATERAL_ANY_INFO,
        CREDIT_STATUS,
        CREDIT_STATUS_CLOSE_DATE,
        --CREATED_BY_2,
        --MODIFIED_BY_2,
        --FK_PERSON,
        INTEREST_RATE
FROM MKR_DATA  -- From CTE above

),


----------------------------------------
-- MKR_DATA_3: Payment History (Overdue Periods)
----------------------------------------

MKR_DATA_3 AS (

SELECT  DISTINCT
        MKR_DATE,
        FIN,
        ID,
        ID_2,
        --ID_3,
        --RECORD_DATE_3,
        --MODIFICATION_DATE_3,
        --STATUS_3,
        --PERIOD_TYPE,
        OVERDUE_PERIOD,
        OVERDUE_DAYS
        --CREATED_BY_3,
        --MODIFIED_BY_3,
        --FK_PERSON_LIABILITY,
        --CREDIT_STATUS_3
FROM MKR_DATA  -- From CTE above

),



-- =============================================================================
-- STAGE 2: PRODUCT DERIVATION
-- =============================================================================
-- Derive key fields: credit type, currency conversion, status, payment string

----------------------------------------
-- MKR_PRODUCT: Derived Product Fields (Updated 04.03.2025)
----------------------------------------

MKR_PRODUCT AS (

SELECT  A.*,
        CASE WHEN CREDIT_TYPE = '003'                            THEN '003'
             WHEN CREDIT_TYPE IN ('002', '005')                  THEN '002'
             WHEN CREDIT_TYPE = '001' AND CREDIT_PURPOSE = '003' THEN '300'
             ELSE '001'
            END AS CREDIT_TYPE_DRV,
    CASE WHEN CONTRACT_DUE_ON = GRANTED_ON THEN 0
           WHEN CREDIT_TYPE NOT IN ('002','003','005') AND INTEREST_RATE = 0 THEN ROUND(INITIAL_AMOUNT_DRV / CEIL(MONTHS_BETWEEN(CONTRACT_DUE_ON, GRANTED_ON)))
           WHEN CREDIT_TYPE NOT IN ('002','003','005') AND INTEREST_RATE > 0
              THEN ROUND((INITIAL_AMOUNT_DRV * INTEREST_RATE/100/12 * POWER((1 + INTEREST_RATE/100/12), CEIL(MONTHS_BETWEEN(CONTRACT_DUE_ON, GRANTED_ON)))) /
                     (POWER((1 + INTEREST_RATE/100/12), CEIL(MONTHS_BETWEEN(CONTRACT_DUE_ON, GRANTED_ON))) - 1), 1)
             ELSE 0
        END AS INSTALLMENT_AMOUNT,
        CASE WHEN CREDIT_STATUS_DRV = '001' AND CREDIT_STATUS_CLOSE_DATE IS NOT NULL THEN CREDIT_STATUS_CLOSE_DATE--UPDATE--04.03.2025
             WHEN CREDIT_STATUS_DRV = '001' AND LAST_PAYMENT_DATE < MKR_DATE         THEN LAST_PAYMENT_DATE--UPDATE--04.03.2025
             WHEN CREDIT_STATUS_DRV = '001'                                          THEN LAST_UPDATE_DATE--UPDATE--04.03.2025
             WHEN CREDIT_STATUS_DRV = '007'                                          THEN NULL--UPDATE--04.03.2025
             WHEN TOTAL_OUTSTANDING_BALANCE > 0                                      THEN NULL
             WHEN LAST_PAYMENT_DATE < A.MKR_DATE                                     THEN LAST_PAYMENT_DATE
             ELSE LAST_UPDATE_DATE
        END AS CREDIT_STATUS_CLOSE_DATE_DRV
FROM
(
    SELECT  A.*,
            CASE WHEN CURRENCY = 'USD' THEN 1.7
                 WHEN CURRENCY = 'EUR' THEN 1.9
                 WHEN CURRENCY = 'RUB' THEN 0.025
                 ELSE 1 END * INITIAL_AMOUNT AS INITIAL_AMOUNT_DRV,
            CASE WHEN CURRENCY = 'USD' THEN 1.7
                 WHEN CURRENCY = 'EUR' THEN 1.9
                 WHEN CURRENCY = 'RUB' THEN 0.025
                 ELSE 1 END * LINE_AMMOUNT AS LINE_AMOUNT_DRV,
            CASE WHEN CURRENCY = 'USD' THEN 1.7
                 WHEN CURRENCY = 'EUR' THEN 1.9
                 WHEN CURRENCY = 'RUB' THEN 0.025
                 ELSE 1 END * OUTSTANDING_DEBT_MAIN AS OUTSTANDING_DEBT_MAIN_DRV,
            CASE WHEN CURRENCY = 'USD' THEN 1.7
                 WHEN CURRENCY = 'EUR' THEN 1.9
                 WHEN CURRENCY = 'RUB' THEN 0.025
                 ELSE 1 END * OUTSTANDING_DEBT_INTEREST AS OUTSTANDING_DEBT_INTEREST_DRV,
            CASE WHEN CURRENCY = 'USD' THEN 1.7
                 WHEN CURRENCY = 'EUR' THEN 1.9
                 WHEN CURRENCY = 'RUB' THEN 0.025
                 ELSE 1 END * (CASE WHEN CREDIT_STATUS = '007' AND LINE_AMMOUNT > 0 AND LINE_AMMOUNT <= 1 AND OUTSTANDING_DEBT_MAIN + OUTSTANDING_DEBT_INTEREST > 0 THEN 0
                          ELSE OUTSTANDING_DEBT_MAIN + OUTSTANDING_DEBT_INTEREST END ) AS TOTAL_OUTSTANDING_BALANCE,--UPDATE--04.03.2025
            ROUND(MONTHS_BETWEEN(CONTRACT_DUE_ON, GRANTED_ON)) AS NUMBER_OF_INSTALLMENTS,
            GREATEST(ROUND(MONTHS_BETWEEN(CONTRACT_DUE_ON, A.MKR_DATE)), 0) AS NUMBER_OF_REST_INSTALLMENTS,
            CASE WHEN CURRENCY = 'USD' THEN 1.7
                 WHEN CURRENCY = 'EUR' THEN 1.9
                 WHEN CURRENCY = 'RUB' THEN 0.025
                 ELSE 1 END * MONTHLY_PAYMENT_AMOUNT AS MONTHLY_PAYMENT_AMOUNT_DRV,
            CASE WHEN BANK_NAME = 'Bank of Baku ASC' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS OWN_DATA_FLAG,
            CASE WHEN CREDIT_STATUS IN ('007', '002', '004', '006', '009') AND LAST_OVERDUE_DAYS > 180 THEN '008'--UPDATE--04.03.2025
                 WHEN CREDIT_STATUS IN ('007', '002', '004', '006', '009')                             THEN '007'
                 WHEN CREDIT_STATUS IN ('001', '010', '012')                                           THEN '001'--UPDATE--04.03.2025
                 WHEN CREDIT_STATUS IN ('003', '008', '011')                                           THEN '008'--UPDATE--04.03.2025
            END AS CREDIT_STATUS_DRV,
            ACCOUNT_PAYMENT_STATUS,
            -- ACCOUNT_PAYMENT_STATUS_DRV: Align payment string to MKR date (inlined ACCPYMTSTDRV)
            CASE WHEN CREDIT_STATUS IN ('007', '002', '004', '006', '009') THEN ACCOUNT_PAYMENT_STATUS
                 ELSE
                    -- Inline ACCPYMTSTDRV: Align payment string based on month difference
                    CASE
                        WHEN (TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(MKR_DATE, 'YYYY')) * 12 + TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(MKR_DATE, 'MM')))
                           - (TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(MX_OVERDUE_PERIOD, 'YYYY')) * 12 + TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(MX_OVERDUE_PERIOD, 'MM'))) <= 0
                        THEN SUBSTR(ACCOUNT_PAYMENT_STATUS,
                                    (-1 * ((TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(MKR_DATE, 'YYYY')) * 12 + TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(MKR_DATE, 'MM')))
                                         - (TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(MX_OVERDUE_PERIOD, 'YYYY')) * 12 + TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(MX_OVERDUE_PERIOD, 'MM'))))) + 1,
                                    LENGTH(ACCOUNT_PAYMENT_STATUS) + ((TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(MKR_DATE, 'YYYY')) * 12 + TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(MKR_DATE, 'MM')))
                                         - (TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(MX_OVERDUE_PERIOD, 'YYYY')) * 12 + TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(MX_OVERDUE_PERIOD, 'MM')))))
                        ELSE LPAD(ACCOUNT_PAYMENT_STATUS,
                                  LENGTH(ACCOUNT_PAYMENT_STATUS) + ((TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(MKR_DATE, 'YYYY')) * 12 + TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(MKR_DATE, 'MM')))
                                       - (TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(MX_OVERDUE_PERIOD, 'YYYY')) * 12 + TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(MX_OVERDUE_PERIOD, 'MM')))),
                                  'N')
                    END
                 END AS ACCOUNT_PAYMENT_STATUS_DRV, --NEW 08.04.2025 (ACCPYMTSTDRV inlined)
            MN_OVERDUE_DAYS_90_DT,
            LAST_OVERDUE_DAYS,
            MX_OVERDUE_PERIOD--NEW--04.03.2025
    FROM
    MKR_DATA_2 A,
    (
    SELECT  ID,ID_2,
                MN_OVERDUE_DAYS_90_DT,
                MAX(LAST_OVERDUE_DAYS) AS LAST_OVERDUE_DAYS,
                LISTAGG(CASE WHEN OVERDUE_DAYS = 9999 THEN 'X'
                             WHEN OVERDUE_DAYS =    0 THEN '0'
                             WHEN OVERDUE_DAYS >= 279 THEN '9'
                             ELSE TO_CHAR(CEIL(OVERDUE_DAYS / 31)) END, '') WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY DT DESC) AS ACCOUNT_PAYMENT_STATUS,
                MX_OVERDUE_PERIOD--NEW--04.03.2025
        FROM
        (
            SELECT  A.ID,A.ID_2,
                    DT,
                    MN_OVERDUE_DAYS_90_DT,
                    NVL(OVERDUE_DAYS, 9999) AS OVERDUE_DAYS,
                    CASE WHEN LAST_DAY(C.OVERDUE_PERIOD) = MX_OVERDUE_PERIOD THEN OVERDUE_DAYS END AS LAST_OVERDUE_DAYS,
                    MX_OVERDUE_PERIOD--NEW--04.03.2025
            FROM
            (
                SELECT  ID,
                    ID_2,
                        MX_OVERDUE_PERIOD,
                        MN_OVERDUE_DAYS_90_DT,
                        TRUNC(DT,'MONTH') AS DT
                FROM
                (
                    SELECT  ID,
                        ID_2,
                            LAST_DAY(MIN(OVERDUE_PERIOD)) AS MN_OVERDUE_PERIOD,
                            LAST_DAY(MAX(OVERDUE_PERIOD)) AS MX_OVERDUE_PERIOD,
                            MIN(CASE WHEN OVERDUE_DAYS > 90 THEN OVERDUE_PERIOD END) AS MN_OVERDUE_DAYS_90_DT
                    FROM MKR_DATA_3
                    GROUP BY ID,
                         ID_2
                ) A,
                (
                    SELECT LAST_DAY(ADD_MONTHS(TO_DATE('2010-01-01','YYYY-MM-DD'), ROWNUM)) AS DT 
                    FROM
                    (
                        SELECT ROWNUM
                        FROM DUAL
                        CONNECT BY ROWNUM <= 500
                    )
                ) B
                WHERE 1 = 1
                AND DT BETWEEN MN_OVERDUE_PERIOD AND MX_OVERDUE_PERIOD
            ) A,
            (--NEW--04.03.2025
                SELECT  ID, ID_2, OVERDUE_PERIOD,--NEW--04.03.2025
                        MAX(OVERDUE_DAYS) AS OVERDUE_DAYS--NEW--04.03.2025
                FROM--NEW--04.03.2025
                MKR_DATA_3--NEW--04.03.2025
                GROUP BY ID, ID_2, OVERDUE_PERIOD--NEW--04.03.2025
            ) C--NEW C--04.03.2025
            WHERE A.ID = C.ID (+) AND A.ID_2 = C.ID_2 (+) AND A.DT = C.OVERDUE_PERIOD (+) --UPDATE--04.03.2025
            ORDER BY 2 DESC
        )
        GROUP BY ID,
             ID_2,
                 MN_OVERDUE_DAYS_90_DT,
                 MX_OVERDUE_PERIOD--NEW--04.03.2025
    ) B
    WHERE 1 = 1
    AND A.ID = B.ID AND A.ID_2 = B.ID_2 
) A

),



-- =============================================================================
-- STAGE 3: FEATURE AGGREGATION BY PRODUCT TYPE
-- =============================================================================

----------------------------------------
-- TMP1: Consumer Loan (CL_) Count Features
----------------------------------------

MKR_LONGLIST_TMP1 AS (

SELECT  A.ID,
        ------------------------------------------------------------------------
        ------- TUKETICI KREDILERI ---------------------------------------------
        ------------------------------------------------------------------------
        -------Kullandirim Adetleri --------------------------------------------
        SUM(CASE WHEN CREDIT_TYPE_DRV = '001' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS CL_CNT_EVER,
        SUM(CASE WHEN CREDIT_TYPE_DRV = '001' AND MKR_DATE - GRANTED_ON BETWEEN 0   AND  30 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS CL_CNT_30D,
        SUM(CASE WHEN CREDIT_TYPE_DRV = '001' AND MKR_DATE - GRANTED_ON BETWEEN 0   AND  90 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS CL_CNT_90D,
        SUM(CASE WHEN CREDIT_TYPE_DRV = '001' AND MKR_DATE - GRANTED_ON BETWEEN 0   AND 182 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS CL_CNT_182D,
        SUM(CASE WHEN CREDIT_TYPE_DRV = '001' AND MKR_DATE - GRANTED_ON BETWEEN 183 AND 365 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS CL_CNT_183D365D,
        -------Acik Kredi Adetleri----------------------------------------------
        SUM(CASE WHEN CREDIT_STATUS_DRV = '007' AND CREDIT_TYPE_DRV = '001' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS CL_OCNT_EVER,
        SUM(CASE WHEN CREDIT_STATUS_DRV = '007' AND CREDIT_TYPE_DRV = '001' AND MKR_DATE - GRANTED_ON BETWEEN   0 AND  90 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS CL_OCNT_90D,
        SUM(CASE WHEN CREDIT_STATUS_DRV = '007' AND CREDIT_TYPE_DRV = '001' AND MKR_DATE - GRANTED_ON BETWEEN   0 AND 182 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS CL_OCNT_182D,
        SUM(CASE WHEN CREDIT_STATUS_DRV = '007' AND CREDIT_TYPE_DRV = '001' AND MKR_DATE - GRANTED_ON BETWEEN 183 AND 365 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS CL_OCNT_183D365D,
        -------Acik ve guncel odeme durumu 0 olan Kredi Adetleri ---------------
